cff-version: 1.2.0
title: MedExtract Lab Bench
message: "Cite this software version and the original dataset used in your experiment."
type: software
version: 0.2.0
authors:
  - name: MedExtract
abstract: >-
  MedExtract Lab Bench is an offline Python benchmark for forecasting measured
  hemoglobin and HbA1c from longitudinal laboratory results. It compares forecasts
  with carrying the last measurement forward. A frozen hemoglobin model from
  Klinikum Lippe was evaluated on surgical patients at Seoul National University
  Hospital. Scorecards report follow-up, forecast error and signed bias.
keywords:
  - hemoglobin
  - HbA1c
  - laboratory results
  - time series forecasting
  - prediction intervals
  - reproducible research
license: MIT
